  "version": "0.1.8",
  "notes": "### Fixed\n- Early check-in and late checkout fees now appear on the folio and are collected at the desk. Before, a fee was recorded on the reservation but never billed, so it showed as \"Not Yet Posted\" and the guest could leave without paying it.\n- Late checkout and early checkout now go through the same balance review as a normal checkout. Before, both completed the checkout directly and skipped the payment check.\n- The Activity Log shows who did what by name (create, room assignment, cancel, reactivate, no-show, extend, move, undo, fees, checkout). Rate edits record the user too.\n- Confirmation numbers use your local date. Bookings taken in the evening were being dated tomorrow, and the daily sequence restarted at 7 PM Central.\n\n### Changed\n- The Late Checkout dialog applies the fee and continues into the Checkout dialog to settle the balance. The Early Checkout dialog shortens the stay and continues the same way.\n- The early check-in fee is included in the balance shown at check-in, so one payment covers the first night and the fee.\n\n### Notes\n- Fees post without tax. Whether lodging tax applies to these fees varies by jurisdiction and will be configurable in a later release.",
